<section class="narrow page-head"><span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span><h1>Simple steps, practical planning</h1><ol><li>Create your account and share your food preferences.</li><li>Complete the lifestyle and safety assessment.</li><li>Choose a package when checkout is enabled.</li><li>FITMEAL prepares an AI-assisted draft using reviewed food data.</li><li>Where required, a qualified nutrition professional reviews the plan.</li><li>Access the approved deliverable through your account.</li></ol><div class="notice">The current MVP is an early build. Payment, AI generation, professional review and PDF delivery are not live yet.</div></section>